# Cafe Widgets Kütüphanesi

Bu paket, kafe ve e-ticaret uygulamaları için özelleştirilebilir, modern arayüz bileşenleri sunar.

## Mevcut Widget'lar

---

### AnimatedRatingModal

```dart
AnimatedRatingModal.show(
  context,
  "ORDER-123", // orderId
  ["Espresso", "Croissant"], // orderItems
  primaryColor: Colors.deepOrange,
  title: "Rate your experience",
  onSubmit: (rating, comment) {
    print("User gave $rating stars and said:$comment");
  },
);
orderId — The unique identifier of the order being rated. This field is required.

orderItems — A list of items (dynamic) associated with the order. This field is required.

primaryColor — The theme color applied to the title, focused input border, and submit button; Color(0xFF6B4E3D) (default) means a dark espresso brown.

title — The main heading displayed inside the modal; "How was your coffee?" (default).

subtitle — The descriptive text beneath the main heading; "Rating us helps us improve our quality." (default).

hintText — The placeholder text inside the comment text field; "Anything you'd like to add? (Optional)" (default).

submitButtonText — The text label on the primary action button; "Submit" (default).

successMessage — The message intended for display post-submission; "Thank you for your feedback!" (default).

onSubmit — Callback function triggered when the form is submitted. It returns the integer rating (1 to 5) and the comment string.